	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="2">No Deal Reached on Philip Morris Bond</td>
		<td valign="top" rowspan="3" width="95" class="imagecredit8"><a href="/news/data/11_ds_400003.asp"><img src="/dsdsmultimedia/photos/CIGARETTE_LAWSUIT2.jpg" width="85" border="0"></a></td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="2" class="citation8">Lawyers for cigarette maker Philip Morris USA and plaintiffs in a $10.1 billion lawsuit failed to reach a compromise Friday over a $12 billion appeal bond the company has been ordered to pay, but are scheduled to meet again on Monday.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_400003.asp">Full Story</a>
