	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="3">L'Oreal Manager Cleared to File Suit</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3" class="citation8">A state appeals court has cleared the way for a discrimination lawsuit by a L'Oreal sales manager who claims she lost her job for refusing to fire a perfume saleswoman her boss considered unattractive.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_399929.asp">Full Story</a>
