	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="3">Judge Overturns Ruling on Kmart Payments</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3" class="citation8">A federal judge has overturned a bankruptcy court's decision allowing Kmart Corp. to make some $300 million in payments to key creditors it owed before it filed for protection from its creditors.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_399918.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
