	<tr>
		<td valign="top" class="headline8" colspan="3">Dow Closes Down 18, Nasdaq Falls 7</td>
	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3" class="citation8">Investors took a cautious approach Friday ahead of next week's rush of earnings reports, sending stocks lower for the third time in four sessions. Mixed economic and earnings news contributed to the sluggish performance.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_399894.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
	</tr>
