	</tr>
	<tr>
		<td valign="top" colspan="3" class="citation8">Duke Energy Corp. will quit the proprietary trading business at its North American merchant energy business as part of its overall strategy to respond to market conditions, the company said Friday.&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href="/news/data/11_ds_399682.asp">Full Story</a>
		</td>
